{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"コンビニ寄ったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46が表紙の週プレさんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いらっしゃったぞ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかも、内容が盛りだくさんだぞ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"立ち読みせずに家に帰って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じっくり読むべきだな。これは"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/26/7359124/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二期生さんの写真を見て思い出した。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"週プレさんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結成当時にもメンバー名鑑を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"載せてくださったのです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それを久しぶりに見たのよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな雰囲気とか変わったな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私なんかまだ前髪無くて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰かわからん状態おうお"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/26/7359124/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/26/7359124/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/26/7359124/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前髪無いだけでクールに見えました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人って変わるなと思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/26/7359124/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6thシングルカップリング曲"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「他の星から」MVが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"YouTubeで公開されました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/26/7359124/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初のユニット曲だったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しかったあです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆったんれいかなぁちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月さゆかなりんとメンツがすごくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影のときは不安でいっぱいでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アニメの曲でありそうな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌詞が不思議な曲になってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"衣装がかわいい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんみつ食べたくなる曲！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MVぜひ見てください。飛んでます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BLTコラボTシャツ第二弾！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/26/7359124/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鮭持ったしろくまりっくま先輩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう！先輩の隣のふきだしが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のデザインのポイント"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/26/7359124/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分だけのオリジナルTシャツに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"してほしい願いです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、うん。例えば"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会で着てきて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私を笑わせる一言でもいいし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何かしてほしいみたいな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お願い書いてもいいし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絵を描いてもいいし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の名前書いてもいいし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自由です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/26/7359124/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ネガティブなことかかないで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"できれば楽しいことかいてね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テーマが幸運だから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分でかいて世界に一つのTシャツ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"着てみませんか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"着たら願いが叶うかも"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/26/7359124/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふふふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもね、これ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一回かいたらもう消えないからね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その辺、考えてね。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/26/7359124/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6thシングル「ガールズルール」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フルがレコチョクにて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日先行配信します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"32名様だけにメンバーの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メッセージ入りポスターを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プレゼントだって"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/26/7359124/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うわうわうわーいいなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポスターいいなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかの欲しい人ー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/26/7359124/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では明日も頑張ろう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}